+    "phq9.p006": "Hub",
+    "phq9.p007": "Following one person over time",
+    "phq9.p008": "This measure exists to answer one question the 14 September briefing asked: does a person move from acute distress towards a clinical disorder, or away from it? It is for repeating with <b>someone already in care</b>, so the second score can be compared with the first.",
+    "phq9.p009": "Who, and which visit",
