+    "ref.p007": "Where a person was sent, and whether they arrived",
+    "ref.p008": "On 14 September the briefing recorded that around 5,000 psychosocial counselling cases had been logged, but that once a person reaches a health facility their case goes into HMIS and is no longer visible here. This form is the join. Without it, “continuum of care” is a claim rather than something anyone can show.",
